message: 'If you use PlasmidPop in your research, please cite it as below.'
type: software
title: 'PlasmidPop'
abstract: 'A browser-based DNA sequence editor and plasmid viewer. Opens, edits and saves GenBank, FASTA and SnapGene files; shows linear and circular maps; finds restriction sites, ORFs and primers; runs pairwise alignments. All computation is client-side.'
